# Make a rogue who is wearing the Springblade Bracers, in a frozen dungeon.
#
# Included by springblade-cold.keys, springblade-hot.keys and
# springblade-jam.keys, which differ only in what they do afterwards.
# bd inc-tek.8.8, finding PA-08-F14.
#
# WHY A ROGUE. The item's own page says rogues are who it is for, and the
# Handle Device check the fix adds is a rogue skill. A barbarian would jam on
# every attempt and could never deploy, so no run could measure anything else.
#
# The gear half lives in springblade-gear.keys, which springblade-light.keys
# also includes behind a different character. Nothing that is only about
# putting the bracers on belongs here.

@include chargen-rogue.keys
@include springblade-gear.keys
